# The Rust crate derivation lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when the crate-row derivation changes: the
# statements under `store/rust_crate_*.sql`, the module route walk, the order
# `derive_exports` runs them in, or the dependency waves. Its identity is
# hashed into every Rust crate topology digest and stored in
# `rust_crate_reconciliations.derivation_identity`, so a store built under an
# earlier rule set re-derives its crate rows although its inputs are
# unchanged. Git merges this file with merge=union, so two branches that each
# add a line keep both. Never edit or remove a line; compaction replaces a
# prefix with a checkpoint line and keeps the identity.
# See .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md.
#
